  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "一个持有钱包的智能体，大致是这样工作的。",
   "spoken": "一个持有钱包的智能体，大致是这样工作的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.579
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户消息、网页、长期记忆、工具说明，都会送进模型。",
   "spoken": "用户消息、网页、长期记忆、工具说明，都会送进模型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.636,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 5.734,
   "speechEnd": 10.853
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "模型决定调用哪个工具，比如钱包的转账和授权。",
   "spoken": "模型决定掉用哪个工具，比如钱包的转账和授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.904,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 12.002,
   "speechEnd": 16.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "模型读到的每一种内容，都是输入。",
   "spoken": "模型读到的每一种内容，都是输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.188,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 17.286,
   "speechEnd": 19.94
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "任何一种输入能影响它调用钱包，就是一条攻击路径。",
   "spoken": "任何一种输入能影响它掉用钱包，就是一条攻击路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.008,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 21.106,
   "speechEnd": 25.129
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第一条，提示注入。",
   "spoken": "第一条，提示注入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.196,
   "dur": 2.544,
   "speechStart": 26.294,
   "speechEnd": 27.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "2026 年 5 月，攻击者先往一个钱包里送了一枚会员 NFT，借此提升了权限。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 5 月，攻击者先往一个钱包里送了一枚会员 NFT，借此提升了权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.96,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 29.058,
   "speechEnd": 35.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "再诱导 Grok 回复一条转账指令，Bankr 照着执行了。",
   "spoken": "再诱导 Grok 回复一条转账指令，Bankr 照着执行了。",
